---
import MailIcon from "./icons/Mail.astro"
import LinkedInIcon from "./icons/LinkedIn.astro"
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden px-6 sm:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950/50">
  <!-- Ambient gradient glow -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 dark:bg-blue-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 dark:bg-purple-500/20 blur-3xl"></div>
  <!-- Subtle grid pattern -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] dark:opacity-[0.05]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, currentColor 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/40 text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-700">
      <span class="relative flex h-1.5 w-1.5">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-green-500 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-1.5 w-1.5 bg-green-500"></span>
      </span>
      <span class="i18n-es">Disponible para nuevos proyectos</span>
      <span class="i18n-en">Available for new projects</span>
    </span>

    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-5 tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
      <span class="i18n-es">¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?</span>
      <span class="i18n-en">Have a project in mind?</span>
    </h2>

    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed i18n-es-block">
      Me encantaría colaborar en tu próximo proyecto. Contáctame para discutir ideas, soluciones técnicas y cómo puedo ayudarte a convertir tu visión en realidad.
    </p>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-10 leading-relaxed i18n-en-block">
      I'd love to collaborate on your next project. Reach out to discuss ideas, technical solutions and how I can help turn your vision into reality.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
      <a
        href="mailto:carlosema322@gmail.com"
        class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-purple-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-600/30 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <MailIcon class="size-4.5 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110" />
        <span class="i18n-es">Envía un email</span>
        <span class="i18n-en">Send an email</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/emanuel-marroquin-160488321/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-200 font-semibold rounded-full hover:border-blue-400 dark:hover:border-blue-600 hover:text-blue-600 dark:hover:text-blue-400 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      >
        <LinkedInIcon class="size-4.5" />
        <span class="i18n-es">Conecta en LinkedIn</span>
        <span class="i18n-en">Connect on LinkedIn</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
